# ==============================================================================
# P0 PERMANENT PUBLIC REPO SANITIZATION RULES (added 2026-10-07 after 9ad2972)
# ==============================================================================
# 0. IDE transient / sandbox caches (.trae/ contained 37 LIVE creds + 2.5MB
#    offline store + 14MB PII CSVs on 2026-10-07). NEVER allow under any git
#    operation, not just sub-rules.
.trae/
.trae/**

# 1. Quarantine directory: extracted sensitive files, never public.
.quarantine/
.quarantine/**

# 2. All env-style configs / machine-bound private material.
.env
.env.*
.creds
.credential-store
.keys/
.keybox/
.lockbox/

# 3. PowerShell credential / DPAPI / security output artifacts.
*.ps1.xml
*_cred.xml
*.dpapi
*.aesgcm
*.aesgcm.dat
*_wrap_*.bin
autorotate.lockbox.*

# 4. PDF / scans / PII / delivery proofs that can contain IBAN / private keys
#    or customer data. Never commit physical document artifacts to a public
#    repo; move to user profile private assets folder.
**/*.pdf
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.tiff
!rank/**/*.svg
!public/**/*.svg
!assets/**/*.svg

# 5. Offline stores / materialized caches derived from base44 or Neon.
**/*-offline-store.json
**/*-materialized.csv

# 6. Standalone owner-run scripts live ONLY locally, never pushed. They
#    declare the OWNER_EXEC_UNLOCK handshake and shell history can leak.
START-OWNER-HANDS-FREE.cmd
*start-owner-hands-free*
*run-live-crypto-po*

# 7. Crash dumps / IDE xml (can contain env snapshots) — already seen 11.
*.dmp
*.crash
*.hdmp
*.mdmp
__pycache__/

# 8. Nested local swarm-runner clone (scheduled task local wrappers).
swarm-runner-repo/
swarm-runner-repo/**

# 9. Runtime logs from scheduled-task wrappers, can contain gate status and
#    injected env presence hints (even if values never printed).
logs/
logs/**
